  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Mandatory for FDA and EMA clinical trial data submissions — if your team touches drug development or regulatory-grade clinical trial data, SDTM is non-negotiable. Freely available to implement (CDISC IP License). The open-source CDISC Rules Engine (MIT) validates SDTM datasets against conformance rules. Adopt as the reference standard for any pipeline ingesting or producing clinical trial tabulation data.",
